            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "we generally should not try to support env var overrides. it can end up being a big burden, where a simple config is expected to support all the little quirks of a build system. e.g. there might be other magic env vars like `RUSTC_EXTRA_ARGS` or whatever, who knows.\n\ni'm not going to block this change, but just noting that this is usually a bad idea.",
            "commit_id": "bec6d1c3ff39a2877a222c6e73c77be1e02aef21",
